cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "snapgrid: recover the pixel grid from damaged pixel art"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/snapgrid"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/snapgrid"
abstract: >-
  Recovers the true pixel grid from smoothed or rescaled pixel art and
  downsamples it back to the original pixels. When the grid cannot be
  recovered reliably it abstains with a stated reason instead of returning a
  wrong grid.
keywords:
  - pixel art
  - grid recovery
  - game art
  - image processing
